{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/wishlist.png?t=1743363916\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to challenge the forces of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your team, upgrade your gear, and embark on a deadly adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat the Demon Lords and seal the portal before it\u2019s too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/DH_New_GIF_001.gif?t=1743363916\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient evil has awakened in the kingdom. Demons have taken over the royal castle and stolen a magical amulet that keeps the portal to otherworldly realms sealed. Without it, darkness will consume the world\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/DH_New_GIF_003.gif?t=1743363916\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But hope is not lost! The legendary Demon Hunters send their bravest warriors to fight against the forces of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/DH_New_GIF_002.gif?t=1743363916\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc79 <strong>What awaits you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong> against bandits, pirates, zombies, skeletons, and demons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your hero</strong> \u2013 a fearless knight,  a young wizard, or a daring pirate girl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character progression</strong> \u2013 upgrade your armor, weapons, and magical artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeons</strong> \u2013 16 levels full of dangers, traps, and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 face off against powerful demon overlords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging storyline</strong> \u2013 complete quests, find allies, and uncover the mysteries of the cursed castle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183640/extras/DH_New_GIF_004.gif?t=1743363916\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Hero, Not Immortal!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/c8347a8180bb886044abb793ecdca50e2a388641.jpg"},{"name":"Chasing the Records","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/a2cc36e292f8725d6e03516c46fc99f17dab8433.jpg"},{"name":"The Legend of the Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/60f9a90729522b8cc216760f505ad723977994c5.jpg"},{"name":"Now I'm Truly Legendary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/40a108c1f2a222b123f107d7fa0424452ec64638.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/2c6a1cd78477701fae9fabe908c9e15b019036b7.jpg"},{"name":"I've Seen You Before!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/9457a7ff65353b131ec467f283e10cab69a9ac5b.jpg"},{"name":"One Step Into the Abyss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/94a690acd7c59cfc3582b0bac967b162ac0eeb58.jpg"},{"name":"Keep Your Pockets Open!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/24fc653b0306d0ec528183cf075b6d0f8566c0c7.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Box Office","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183640/254a62bb63325d850ef5af20663b8cfe9c598bdc.jpg"}